# Manifold level 10
# The tower's first floor (stages 5b and 5c): a floor to prove the games' shell and the platformer's
# controller, not one of the tower's own (5d builds those by the gym's measures). Up a stair onto
# platforms a meter up, across a gap of 3 m, up two stairs to the goal 3 m up; a star on a block 3 m
# high beside the first platforms, its ledge grabbed from a jump (the gym: up to 3.25 m). Later in
# the evening, a lamp lit over the goal.
title The first floor
spawn 0 1 6
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.7
sky 19.25

kit floor_4  -4 0 6
kit floor_4  0 0 6
kit floor_4  4 0 6
kit floor_4  -4 0 2
kit floor_4  0 0 2
kit floor_4  4 0 2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -2
kit floor_4  0 0 -2
kit floor_4  4 0 -2
kit floor_4  -4 0 -6
kit floor_4  0 0 -6
kit floor_4  4 0 -6
kit floor_4  -4 0 -10
kit floor_4  0 0 -10
kit floor_4  4 0 -10
kit floor_4  -4 0 -14
kit floor_4  0 0 -14
kit floor_4  4 0 -14
kit floor_4  -4 0 -18
kit floor_4  0 0 -18
kit floor_4  4 0 -18
kit floor_4  -4 0 -22
kit floor_4  0 0 -22
kit floor_4  4 0 -22

kit stairs_1    0 0 0
kit platform_2  0 0 -2
kit platform_2  0 0 -4
kit platform_2  0 0 -9
kit platform_2  0 0 -11
kit platform_2  0 0 -13
kit stairs_1    0 1 -15
kit platform_2  0 1 -17
kit stairs_1    0 2 -19
kit platform_2  0 2 -21
kit platform_2  3.5 0 -3
kit platform_2  3.5 1 -3
kit platform_2  3.5 2 -3

lamp 0 5.5 -21  7 1

sensor checkpoint  0 1.8 -11    1 0.8 3
sensor goal        0 3.8 -21    1 0.8 1
sensor star        3.5 3.8 -3   0.6 0.8 0.6
sensor fall        0 -6 0       60 3 60
